---
#3959, track §11 and §14.1 `bynk.given.binding_missing`, two candidates: the caller holds two
instances of `Kv`, so the fix offers both and is not machine-applicable; `bynk check --fix`
leaves the call alone (`integration::capability_binding_fix`), and neither instance is
reported unused, whose removal fix would otherwise take one away.
---
context shop

consumes bynk { Logger }
consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv, D1 }
uses lib.cache

capability Sessions = Kv
capability Archive = Kv
capability Orders = D1

fn save(key: String) -> Effect[String] given Sessions, Archive, Logger {
	remember(key, "v")
}
